        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen worktop, chromium steel, high-end, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen worktop, chromium steel, high-end, at plant
na;
UUID: a3cfa40d-832c-3cc9-a665-549f8257e96e
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing a high end chromium steel kitchen countertop. The chromium steel plate is 8 mm wide and has no mounting panel. An average kitchen countertop has the measures of 2400 mm x 600 mm (1.44 m2). The sink is not included. The dataset includes EUR-pallets and LDPE foil for packaging.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: high-end chromium steel product, 8 mm wide
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a3cfa40d-832c-3cc9-a665-549f8257e96e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
